WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.670
- [Narrator] Baguettes in
Paris are like fish in water.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.620
Birds in the sky, tourists at Notre Dame.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.793
They just belong.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.600
And there is one man
who makes the fluffiest,

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.330
crispiest baguettes in all of Paris.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.430
He is a master of the
most French food there is

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:23.533
and he happens to be the
son of a Tunisian immigrant.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:26.116
(upbeat music)

00:02:45.623 --> 00:02:47.873
(low beep)

